WEBVTT

00:10:28.401 --> 00:10:30.267
where, as bad as things got,

00:10:30.267 --> 00:10:33.736
only four percent expressed their opinion to a public official,

00:10:33.736 --> 00:10:37.048
today 90 percent tell us

00:10:37.048 --> 00:10:39.320
that if there's a problem in their community,

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:41.753
it's up to them to fix it.

00:10:41.753 --> 00:10:49.446
(Applause)

00:10:49.446 --> 00:10:51.249
And three-fourths

00:10:51.249 --> 00:10:54.080
believe they not only have the responsibility,

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:57.050
but the power to make change.

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:59.314
And this empowerment

00:10:59.314 --> 00:11:02.246
also applies to women,